// DuPont Check
// Table: _Measures
// Display folder: Category\04 Analysis\DuPont;Pages\04 Notes & Evidence
// Format: 0.0000%
// Hidden: false
// DuPont ROE minus ROE. Should be ~0 when averages are used consistently. A material value signals a filter or missing-balance issue.

DuPont Check =
[DuPont ROE] - [ROE]
